(survey-summary)
*title Survey and summarize
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=surv-1 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file survey.dat time xecfc xecfcdt
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*survey 1 speed vals=10,20,30
*summarize final-x
  add last(xecfc[1])
*end
